---
// Troop ↔ team pairing request. Posts to Formspree — the form ID placeholder is
// swapped for the real one by a human before launch.
---

<div class="pairing-card not-content">
  <h3>🤝 The Pairing Form</h3>
  <p>
    Whether you're a troop looking for a team or a team looking for troops, fill
    this out and we'll pair you with a partner in your area. (Your info is only
    used for pairing — nothing else.)
  </p>

  <form action="https://formspree.io/f/YOUR_PAIRING_FORM_ID" method="POST">
    <input type="hidden" name="form_type" value="pairing-request" />

    <div class="row">
      <div class="col">
        <label for="f-role">I am a…</label>
        <select id="f-role" name="role" required>
          <option value="">Choose one</option>
          <option>Girl Scout troop leader — looking for a robotics team</option>
          <option>Robotics team member / mentor — looking for troops</option>
          <option>Parent / other</option>
        </select>

        <label for="f-name">Name</label>
        <input id="f-name" name="name" required autocomplete="name" />

        <label for="f-email">Email</label>
        <input id="f-email" name="email" type="email" required autocomplete="email" />

        <label for="f-num">Troop number or team number</label>
        <input id="f-num" name="troop_or_team_number" placeholder="e.g., Troop 383 or FRC 2974" />
      </div>

      <div class="col">
        <label for="f-loc">City &amp; state</label>
        <input id="f-loc" name="location" required placeholder="e.g., Marietta, GA" />

        <label for="f-levels">Levels interested in</label>
        <select id="f-levels" name="levels">
          <option>Brownies (grades 2–3)</option>
          <option>Juniors (grades 4–5)</option>
          <option>Cadettes (grades 6–8)</option>
          <option>Multiple levels</option>
        </select>

        <label for="f-badges">Badges of interest</label>
        <input id="f-badges" name="badges" placeholder="e.g., Robotics series, Cybersecurity Basics" />

        <label for="f-msg">Anything else?</label>
        <textarea id="f-msg" name="message" rows="3" placeholder="Group size, timing, location constraints…"
        ></textarea>
      </div>
    </div>

    <button type="submit">Request a pairing</button>
    <p class="hint">
      Submissions go straight to the Girls Build Bots inbox — we'll introduce you
      to a partner by email, typically within a week.
    </p>
  </form>
</div>

<style>
  .pairing-card {
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem 1.5rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--sl-color-gray-5);
    border-radius: 0.5rem;
    background: var(--sl-color-gray-7, var(--sl-color-gray-6));
  }
  .pairing-card h3 {
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
    font-size: var(--sl-text-h4);
  }
  .pairing-card > p {
    font-size: var(--sl-text-sm);
    color: var(--sl-color-gray-2);
  }
  form {
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }
  .row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 0 1.25rem;
  }
  @media (max-width: 40rem) {
    .row {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
  .col {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.25rem;
  }
  label {
    margin-top: 0.6rem;
    font-size: var(--sl-text-sm);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  input,
  select,
  textarea {
    width: 100%;
    padding: 0.5rem 0.6rem;
    font: inherit;
    font-size: var(--sl-text-sm);
    color: var(--sl-color-white);
    background: var(--sl-color-black);
    border: 1px solid var(--sl-color-gray-5);
    border-radius: 0.35rem;
  }
  button {
    margin-top: 1rem;
    padding: 0.55rem 1.2rem;
    font: inherit;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--sl-color-black);
    background: var(--sl-color-accent);
    border: 0;
    border-radius: 0.35rem;
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  button:hover {
    background: var(--sl-color-accent-high);
  }
  .hint {
    margin-top: 0.6rem;
    font-size: var(--sl-text-xs);
    color: var(--sl-color-gray-3);
  }
</style>
